Package: rambur
Title: Design and Analysis of Intertidal Chamber Experiments
Version: 0.5.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Duy Nghia", "Pham", email = "nghiapham@yandex.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1349-1710")),
    person("Inna M.", "Sokolova", role = "ctb",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2068-4302"))
    )
Description: Facilitates the design and analysis of intertidal chamber
    experiments. It supports generating experimental profiles for
    'ElectricBlue' intertidal chambers, reading log files, and checking
    actual chamber conditions against designed profiles. It also helps
    read log files from 'EnvLogger' robomussels (or temperature loggers)
    and 'Pulse V2' heart rate loggers, and provides an algorithm to extract
    heart rates from 'Pulse V2' records. The acronym stands for Research
    Assistant in Marine Biology at the University of Rostock.
